                <pb facs="0206" n="146" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg146"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-27"><hi rendition="#italic">September 27,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Six criminals executed Chengtu; thirteen punished—banished, imprisonment,
                    bambooing.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
